rd), `tests/test_dashboard_web.py` (+embeddability-all-routes, +no-writes session, +launcher regression), `docs/foreman-handoff-dashboard/DASHBOARD.md` (new).\n- **Embeddability (PM2):** `test_embeddability_every_route_on_bare_flask` mounts the blueprint on a bare host app and exercises all 10 `/api/*` routes â€” full Anchor-tab boundary, not just liveness.\n- **Read-only (hard constraint #1):** hermetic no-writes test + live smoke both prove KB/report mtimes unchanged after a full session.\n- **Real bug caught by live boot (the test client missed it):** the launcher banner crashed on a cp1252 console (UnicodeEncodeError on âœ¦/â”€). Fixed with an ASCII fallback + regression test; server now boots under cp1252 and serves every panel (index 200, morning/health/catalog all correct on live data).\n- **Headless render:** sunburst draws 80 wedge paths over the live 74-group catalog, no NaN/undefined.\n- **DASHBOARD.md:** run command, module map, exact Anchor-tab mount steps, and the deferred force-directed-graph note (Stage-0 G1).\n- **Gate:** 48 dashboard tests + **full suite 1077 passed** (1029 existing + 48), zero regressions, in 72s.\n\n---\n\n## Project DONE â€” 2026-06-11\n\nAll 6 waves GREEN. The Aurora Dashboard is built, tested (48 hermetic dashboard tests; full suite 1077\ngreen), and live-verified read-only against the real KB + reports. Run it: `.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe\naurora_dashboard.py` â†’ http://127.0.0.1:5001. Foreman well-formedness gate (locate-plan.mjs) re-run\nclean. Deferred (named, not built): the force-directed knowledge graph (DASHBOARD.md).\n","numLines":74,"startLine":1,"totalLines":74}}}
